### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Create (201; repeat -> 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/info
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "md5": "{{md5}}",
  "name": "Trojan.Win32.Generic",
  "description": "Collects browser credentials",
  "threat_type": "trojan",
  "severity": "high",
  "tags": ["windows", "banking"],
  "first_seen": "2026-01-02T12:00:00+03:00",
  "last_seen": "2026-01-03T09:00:00Z"
}

### Read (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/info/{{md5}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Full replacement (omitted optional fields reset to defaults)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/info/{{md5}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "name": "Trojan.Win32.Updated",
  "severity": "critical"
}

### Invalid MD5 (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/info/invalid
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Missing threat (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/info/00000000000000000000000000000000
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
